    {
      "id": "0txwn",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math>&nbsp;has a single structure i.e., resonance hybrid of the above three structures.",
