  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Resonating structure are hypothetical and resonance hybrid is real structure which is weighted average of all the resonating structures.</p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;has a single structure i.e. resonance hybrid of the three structures.</p>",
